# Keep LF everywhere: shell scripts, the Dockerfile and YAML are copied into Linux
# containers and break with CRLF line endings (a Windows checkout would add them).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.onnx binary
*.pt binary
*.joblib binary
*.so binary
*.zip binary
